==Strategy==
Crazed Cow forms a deadly duo with Crazed Cat, as the latter is an extremely hard pusher with obscene amounts of health and speed, whose only weaknesses are their knockbacks and their somewhat short range. Then there's Crazed Cow who in swarms and will through your front lines in a few seconds and comes in many waves, each larger and more aggressive than the last.

Victory on this stage depends on building and maintaining stacks of mid-range attackers very quickly and efficiently. With the sheer amount of Crazed Cow Cats that break through your meatshield line, it is very hard to rely on hard-hitting Ubers on this stage–even if they can one-shot the Cows, they will just be replaced in seconds.

Both [[Bird Cat (Normal Cat)|The Flying Cat]] and [[Crazed Bird Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Flying Cat]] are very valuable assets here, as well as [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Cyborg Cat]]. [[Onmyoji Cat (Rare Cat)|Thaumaturge Cat]] is almost mandatory with its [[Weaken|weaken]] effect. By building up a strong, constant stack of these units behind aggressive meatshielding, it is possible to outlast the Cows and ensure victory. Additionally, this keeps your money curve low. Bringing a Cat CPU can help greatly to counteract the enemy numbers, but watch your money closely!

===Recommended Units===
*[[Teacher BearCat (Rare Cat)|Teacher BearCat]]: Outranges the Crazed Cows, allowing for you to kill them quickly.
*[[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Express Cat]]: At level 40, can one-shot the Crazed Cows after a single hit from Awakened Bahamut and with two Attack Up SM combos. Attack Combos are not neccessary at higher levels.
*[[Ancient Egg: N001 (Special Cat)|Haniwa Cat]]: One of the only viable [[:Category:Anti-Traitless Cats|anti-Traitless]] meatshields for this stage.
*[[Mightycat (Rare Cat)|Mightycat]]: Allows you to stall easier.
*[[Onmyoji Cat (Rare Cat)|Thaumaturge Cat]]: Similar to Mightycat, but from a safer distance.
*[[Ancient Egg: N005 (Special Cat)|Hitman Cat]]: If owned, Hitman Cat can deal huge damage to all threats and is very stackable. Just be mindful of his blindspot and bring something to shake off anything that infiltrates (like the aforementioned Teacher BearCat).

===Recommended Ubers===
Any [[EPICFEST (Gacha Event)|EPICFEST]] Ubers you have will work wonders on this stage (i.e [[D'arktanyan (Uber Rare Cat)|D'arktanyan]]/[[Lone Moon Lunos (Uber Rare Cat)|Lone Moon Lunos]]).

